00:03:16.811 --> 00:03:18.890
What do we actually need
from these algorithms?

00:03:18.891 --> 00:03:20.600
The first thing
is sort of a given

00:03:20.601 --> 00:03:22.620
just if you're an
algorithm designer like me,

00:03:22.621 --> 00:03:23.700
this is what you're
