00:03:30.936 --> 00:03:33.235
But the other things
a little bit less defined.

00:03:33.236 --> 00:03:34.500
We somehow want the

00:03:34.501 --> 00:03:36.110
algorithms that are
going to actually have

00:03:36.111 --> 00:03:37.650
impact on practice or

00:03:37.651 --> 00:03:39.780
