actually bring up the speed.

00:04:14.891 --> 00:04:18.630
So sort of the thesis of
this talking of a lot of

00:04:18.631 --> 00:04:20.090
my research is that really

00:04:20.091 --> 00:04:21.730
simple randomized methods often

00:04:21.731 --> 00:04:23.490
