00:08:51.771 --> 00:08:52.955
With random sketching,

00:08:52.956 --> 00:08:54.800
yes it's an algorithm
but what you're really

00:08:54.801 --> 00:08:56.630
doing is you're saying I

00:08:56.631 --> 00:08:58.630
have a random matrix
that I generated.

00:08:58.631 --> 00:09:00.050
I applied this to my data set.

00:09:00.051 --> 00:09:01.400
What's the effect of this random

00:09:01.401 --> 00:09:02.690
when your math on my data set?

00:09:02.691 --> 00:09:04.510
And so it's a rather
simple thing to

00:09:04.511 --> 00:09:07.130
sort of try to pin down and
figure out what it's doing.

00:09:07.131 --> 00:09:10.910
Okay. So this has

00:09:10.911 --> 00:09:12.130
