00:23:47.521 --> 00:23:48.990
So, this would sort of overcome

00:23:48.991 --> 00:23:51.050
the issue with uniform sampling.

00:23:51.051 --> 00:23:54.500
So, these non-uniform
sampling approaches,

00:23:54.501 --> 00:23:56.735
these sort of important
sampling approaches,

00:23:56.736 --> 00:24:00.480
often work really well
in practice but the issue

00:24:00.481 --> 00:24:02.210
is that there it's
