00:24:04.311 --> 00:24:05.740
We can run a sampling scheme,

00:24:05.741 --> 00:24:08.140
we can see what we get as far
as classification accuracy,

00:24:08.141 --> 00:24:09.320
or some downstream thing,

00:24:09.321 --> 00:24:11.525
and we can declare that
