a lot of different contexts,

00:35:10.396 --> 00:35:12.270
and it's sort of
known how to derive

00:35:12.271 --> 00:35:14.510
good sampling probabilities in

00:35:14.511 --> 00:35:16.665
order to obtain this bound
with good probability.

00:35:16.666 --> 00:35:18.480
So there has been some work

00:35:18.481 --> 00:35:20.270
in Matrix approximation
literature,

00:35:20.271 --> 00:35:21.720
also in spectrograph theory,

00:35:21.721 --> 00:35:23.340
algebraic graph theory trying

