example are like the properly
defined levered score.

00:38:03.311 --> 00:38:06.475
So, it's not so far what
people do in practice,

00:38:06.476 --> 00:38:08.040
but it's sort of a cleaner,

00:38:08.041 --> 00:38:11.735
it can give you some cleaner
guarantees when you sample.

